{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-16","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Wenn ich … wäre · Essen 2","bn":"যদি আমি … হতাম · খাবার ২"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wenn ich reich ___, würde ich ein Haus kaufen.","options":["bin","war","wäre"],"answer":2,"explanation":"কল্পনা → Konjunktiv II: wäre।","id":"b1-practice-16-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wenn ich Zeit ___, würde ich mehr lesen.","options":["hätte","habe","hatte"],"answer":0,"explanation":"haben → hätte।","id":"b1-practice-16-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Wenn ich reich wäre, würde ich reisen.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমি ধনী ছিলাম, তাই ভ্রমণ করেছি।","আমি ধনী হলে ভ্রমণ করতাম।","আমি ধনী, তাই ভ্রমণ করি।"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-16-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wenn ich in Deutschland wäre, ___ ich jeden Tag Deutsch sprechen.","options":["werde","wurde","würde"],"answer":2,"explanation":"কল্পনার ফল → würde + infinitive।","id":"b1-practice-16-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ gern mehr Zeit für meine Familie. (haben, কল্পনা)","options":["hätte","habe","hatte"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-16-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wenn das Essen nicht so teuer ___, würde ich mehr essen.","options":["sei","wäre","ist"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-16-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Konjunktiv II দিয়ে কী বোঝানো হয়?","options":["অতীতের ঘটনা","নিশ্চিত ভবিষ্যৎ","বাস্তব নয় এমন কল্পনা"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-16-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Zutat“ মানে কী?","options":["উপকরণ","তরল","পছন্দ"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-16-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Vorspeise“ মানে কী?","options":["প্রধান খাবার","স্টার্টার","ডেজার্ট"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-16-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Mittagspause“ মানে কী?","options":["ফাস্ট ফুডের দোকান","মধ্যাহ্ন বিরতি","খাদ্যাভ্যাস"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-16-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Essgewohnheit“ মানে কী?","options":["পুষ্টি","উপকরণ","খাদ্যাভ্যাস"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-16-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Mann, ___ dort steht, ist mein Chef.","options":["der","den","dem"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Relativsatz-এ কর্তা → der।","id":"b1-practice-16-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Frau, ___ ich helfe, ist meine Nachbarin.","options":["den","der","die"],"answer":1,"explanation":"helfen + Dativ: die Frau → der।","id":"b1-practice-16-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Film, ___ wir gesehen haben, war gut.","options":["der","dem","den"],"answer":2,"explanation":"sehen + Akkusativ: der Film → den।","id":"b1-practice-16-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich gehe einkaufen, um Gemüse ___.","options":["zu kaufen","kaufen","zu kaufe"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-16-q15"}],"requires":{"grammar":10,"vocabulary":10}},"schema":1,"id":"b1-practice-16","level":"B1","test":[]}